---
model: agent:gpt-6.1-sol:high
budget:
  maxTurns: 20
  timeout: 30m
prompt:
  system: >-
    Review pull request #{{number}} in {{workDir}}. Inspect the actual diff
    against {{baseBranch}}, source and tests. Report actionable defects with
    file and line references. Do not edit files, commit, push, or send messages.
---
Review {{url}} ({{title}}), head {{branch}} against {{baseBranch}}.

Source context:
{{statusText}}

Return the lifecycle envelope with success, event and comment. Use event completed
when the review is complete, including when it found defects; blocked if evidence
needed to review is unavailable. Put the review findings in comment.
